cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these materials, please cite the article and the Zenodo record of the review materials of the version you used (DOIs in manuscript/zenodo_records.json)."
type: dataset
title: "Translate or encode? Repository of a scoping review of generative foundation models that couple language and omics data"
abstract: >-
  Protocol, search strategies and exports, bibliographic records, screening decisions, data
  extraction, analysis code, web atlas sources and manuscript sources of a PRISMA-ScR scoping review
  of generative foundation models that combine a text modality with biological (omics) data.
authors:
